      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "WHIPSTICK BOBBI (8) was big odds last time but gave a huge sight after a fast early split, weakening late to finish a 2.5 lengths fourth (25.44) over 450m at this track. Comes through a solid form race last start. Ready to return to form. DELATITE BEAST (1) is going well, finishing in the placings twice in a row. Not beaten far last time when a neck second (22.63) in a Special conditions Veteran race at this track. Well placed here and can atone this time. AUNTY FAYE (2) was sent out big odds but was a fast winner (31.29) last time in a Grade 5 at Ballarat. Has a good record at this journey. Form from her last run is proving to be solid. One of the leading chances again. GOLD CLASS COOL (7) can run a bold race on best form.",
